{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hacking. Dial tone. Cassette decks. Sabotage. Suitcase decks. Brainbox injectors.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quadrilateral Cowboy is a first-person adventure in a cyberpunk world. Tread lightly through security systems with your hacking deck and grey-market equipment. With top-of-the-line hardware like this, it means just one thing: you answer only to the highest bidder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of the Independent Games Festival <strong>Seumas McNally Grand Prize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of the\u00a0Independent Games Festival <strong>Excellence in Design award</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of the IndieCade <strong>Grand Jury award</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/240440/extras/55966d4f3146478f68a2b2296f18b36f.webp?t=1770676021\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/240440/extras/55966d4f3146478f68a2b2296f18b36f.poster.avif?t=1770676021\" class=\"bb_img\" width=432 height=134 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to infiltrate quietly, low and slow? Or smash and grab, loud and fast? The choice is yours. Each heist is a systemic clockworld world of security systems waiting to be broken.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HACKABLE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type commands into our intuitive hacking interface to hijack doors, weapons, cameras, robots, and more. Subvert burglar alarms, master your hacking deck, and devise your own unique route like a smooth operator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOOLS OF THE TRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Deck to hack. Blast yourself across the sky with the Launcher Pad. Remotely control the high-powered rifle in the Autocase. Pilot the tiny but mighty Weevil robot. The only limit is your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET IMMERSED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the retro-futuristic world of Quadrilateral Cowboy and experience the many highs and lows of your cyber-heist crew. Saddle up, cowboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/240440/extras/172d63124afccda6347056452f656ca7.avif?t=1770676021\" width=150 height=135 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EDITIONS:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Standard Edition</strong> includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quadrilateral Cowboy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer Commentary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reference Manual.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Deluxe Edition</strong> includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything In the <strong>Standard Edition</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quadrilateral Cowboy interactive art book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PDFs for box art, poster, and papercraft characters.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finger Lime Funicular","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240440/d2c271bd6c56267831e1f39b74e83cdb83c03d0f.jpg"},{"name":"The Satsuma Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240440/fa9310497ce0b722b6febd24a45bf65dd49fd8a3.jpg"},{"name":"Bergamot Towers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240440/f38078b8c6904350e19f33a33c101c397547791c.jpg"},{"name":"Repulse Bay Clinic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240440/194c4db8e37cf23e8c3441ac4d6b517711d11f92.jpg"},{"name":"Valencia Villa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s