 the many highs and lows of your cyber-heist crew. Saddle up, cowboy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/240440/extras/172d63124afccda6347056452f656ca7.avif?t=1770676021\" width=150 height=135 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EDITIONS:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Standard Edition</strong> includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quadrilateral Cowboy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer Commentary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reference Manual.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Deluxe Edition</strong> includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything In the <strong>Standard Edition</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quadrilateral Cowboy interactive art book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PDFs for box art, poster, and papercraft characters.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Blendo Games"],"dlc":[489490],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/240440/header.jpg?t=1770676021","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> glibc 2.17+, 64-bit only<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 9800 GT or ATI Radeon HD 5750, 1 GB video RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.9 Mavericks or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA or ATI GPU, 1 GB video RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"me